    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "French illustrator, graphic designer and animator, now Tokyo-based (came up via the Paris skate scene: zines, board/clothing design, then hand-lettering school into graphic design and animation). Warm, nostalgic, mixed analog/digital animation. Clients incl. Nike, Dickies, Rimowa, Farfetch, LOfficiel, Hermes (Saut Hermes 23 identity). Agency-repped (Monsieur lAgent). Mid-to-senior independent artist (~10 yrs). Autonomy 5: self-directed practice across illustration, graphic design and motion. Freelance per self-maintained site and IG. Country updated to Japan + France (Behance still lists Paris). Capabilities currently only Illustration; he also does graphic design and animation (see Open Question).",
